### List sole propietorship in CEIDG by NIP
GET {{ceidgUrl}}/firmy?nip={{jdgNip}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ceidgApiKey}}

### List sole propietorship details in CEIDG
GET {{ceidgUrl}}/firma/{{jdgId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ceidgApiKey}}

### List company in CEIDG should fail
GET {{ceidgUrl}}/firmy?nip={{companyNip}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ceidgApiKey}}

### List sole propietorship from lookup entrypoint should succeed
GET {{baseUrl}}/gov/ceidg?nip={{jdgNip}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List sole propietorship from lookup entrypoint should fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/gov/ceidg?nip={{companyNip}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}